    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to <strong>RE-EXIT</strong>, a psychological horror, spot the anomaly game that challenges your perception and attention to detail. Trapped in a temporal loop caused by an unexplained anomaly, your mission is to observe your surroundings carefully and report any irregularities to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Detection:</strong> Each time the elevator doors open, scrutinize the corridor for any changes. Anomalies can be <strong>subtle</strong> or <strong>overt</strong>, testing your observational skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles that test your logic and observation skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threats and Traps:</strong> Encounter deadly enemies and  traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Loop:</strong> Successfully identify anomalies eight times in a row to  realign the distortions and escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/6d65a18071d384cb336c2855a3c45620.avif?t=1747039893\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:\u00a0</strong>Approximately 3-4 hours, to discover and experience all anomalies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you trust your senses enough to escape the loop?</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Developer's Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RE-EXIT</i> is developed by a solo indie developer. Your support and feedback are highly appreciated and will help in refining the game further.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Welcome to <strong>RE-EXIT</strong>, a psychological horror, spot the anomaly game that challenges your perception and attention to detail. Trapped in a temporal loop caused by an unexplained anomaly, your mission is to observe your surroundings carefully and report any irregularities to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Detection:</strong> Each time the elevator doors open, scrutinize the corridor for any changes. Anomalies can be <strong>subtle</strong> or <strong>overt</strong>, testing your observational skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/4a55801c1dc41f661ede1ecb02bd5101.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles that test your logic and observation skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/bcb3f003bc2de37cfb73abb03d411031.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threats and Traps:</strong> Encounter deadly enemies and  traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.poster.avif?t=1747039893\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.webm?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/19c72b8ae105e4ac01332d3c9b1be8df.mp4?t=1747039893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Loop:</strong> Successfully identify anomalies eight times in a row to  realign the distortions and escape the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318470/extras/6d65a18071d384cb336c2855a3c45620.avif?t=1747039893\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:\u00a0</strong>Approximately 3-4 hours, to discover and experience all anomalies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you trust your senses enough to escape the loop?</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Developer's Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RE-EXIT</i> is developed by a solo indie developer. Your support and feedback are highly appreciated and will help in refining the game further.</p>",
